## Catatan / Note

Lisensi MIT di atas mencakup file-file yang dibuat untuk repo ini: loader
(`swarm-bookmarklet.js`), patch mobile (`swarm-mobile.js`), dokumentasi
(`README.md`, `README_EN.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`), dan demo (`demo.svg`,
`docs/screenshot-poco.jpg`).

Lisensi ini **TIDAK** mencakup `swarm.js` — engine Swarm Rebuild dari
upstream — yang **tidak ada** di repo ini. File tersebut dimuat saat runtime
langsung dari repo [DhvanilPatel/swarm-cursors](https://github.com/DhvanilPatel/swarm-cursors)
dan tetap menjadi milik pembuatnya. Repo upstream saat ini belum berlisensi.

The MIT license above covers the files created for this repository: the loader
(`swarm-bookmarklet.js`), the mobile patch (`swarm-mobile.js`), the
documentation (`README.md`, `README_EN.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`), and the demo
(`demo.svg`, `docs/screenshot-poco.jpg`).

It does **NOT** cover `swarm.js` — the upstream Swarm Rebuild engine — which
is **not** included in this repository. That file is loaded at runtime
directly from [DhvanilPatel/swarm-cursors](https://github.com/DhvanilPatel/swarm-cursors)
and remains the property of its author. The upstream repo is currently
unlicensed.
